{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is designed to give you a brief taste of the horror-filled world of Iblis3:Phenomena. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This special version, offered as part of Steam Next Fest, includes selected scenes from the first part of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Highlights: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Single-player, atmospheric horror experience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Turkish-Islamic themed metaphysical events </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Gloomy houses, abandoned structures and encounters with the unknown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Limited gameplay time (~20 minutes) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f Note: This version only includes a small portion of the full game. The full version of the game will include more areas, stories, enemies and puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**Are you ready for the dark?**</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863350?t=1752571630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863350/2f3fb3f8aab5d95058d7dc0fc81038538cb0102b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752571630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863350/02722732ae0e921f886a5a6b5350b318d46c7c7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752571630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863350/02722732ae0e921f886a5a6b5350b318d46c7c7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752571630","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is designed to give you a brief taste of the horror-filled world of Iblis3:Phenomena. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This special version, offered as part of Steam Next Fest, includes selected scenes from the first part of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae High